    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The findings of a major international clinical trial EFFORT, recently presented at a conference hosted by Aga Khan University (AKU), offer new hope for the global fight against Plasmodium vivax malaria - the most prevalent strain in Pakistan accounting for over 80% of cases in the country. The results hold significant promise for transforming how the disease is treated and, ultimately, eliminated.",
